; Room 7 ($07): Cuckoo's Nest
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 2 cells from row 12 column 13 up to
; row 11 column 14, rising to the right.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 7 column 15.
; .
; Exits: left Room 8 (Inside the MegaTrunk, #R$C800); right Room 0 (The Off
; Licence, #R$C000); up Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000); down Room 2 (Under
; the MegaTree, #R$C200). Odd: the up exit of Room 2 is Room 0, not this room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $27 (at $A138) start $90; slot 1: definition
; $6F (at $A378) start $05; slot 2: definition $3C (at $A1E0) start $A4. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
@label=RoomCuckoosNest
