 $C7F0 DEFB $27,$90 ; definition $27, start $90 (column 16)
 $C7F2 DEFB $6F,$05 ; definition $6F, start $05 (column 5)
 $C7F4 DEFB $3C,$A4 ; definition $3C, start $A4 (column 4)
